{"max_tokens":8192,"messages":[{"content":"Follow the public QA protocol in the user message. It contains the current task, evidence, state, tool/interface rules and strict response schemas. Make the choices required by that interface and return exactly one allowed JSON Action, Update, or Final. Use only this request. Do not output Markdown, private reasoning or native tool calls. Do not invent evidence or alter the contract.","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"context\":{\"answer_unit\":\"percent\",\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_context:f95f8c9f770a7a26ec7d3a678eb326cf4d1b1161d08c265d2d517077d7f53dbb\",\"indexing\":\"Prelocated relevant numeric evidence with original offsets and necessary source context; no arithmetic plan. Same numeric IDs and values as the complete source.\",\"information_condition\":\"E\",\"necessary_context\":{\"p0\":{\"locator\":[\"pre_text\",0],\"text\":\"summary fin 48 changes during fiscal 2008 , our aggregate changes in our total gross amount of unrecognized tax benefits are summarized as follows: .\"},\"q0\":{\"locator\":[\"post_text\",0],\"text\":\"the gross liability for unrecognized tax benefits at november 28 , 2008 of $ 139.5 million is exclusive of interest and penalties .\"}},\"numeric_catalog\":[{\"end\":204,\"id\":\"source:q2n2\",\"index\":2,\"segment\":\"q2\",\"start\":200,\"token\":\"15.3\",\"value\":\"153/10\"},{\"end\":8,\"id\":\"source:t6c1n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t6c1\",\"start\":2,\"token\":\"139549\",\"value\":\"139549\"}],\"question\":\"the combined amount of accrued interest and penalties related to tax positions taken on our tax returns and included in non-current income taxes payable was what percent of the total ending balance as of november 28 2008?\",\"related_source_fragments\":{\"q2\":{\"locator\":[\"post_text\",2],\"text\":\"as of november 28 , 2008 , the combined amount of accrued interest and penalties related to tax positions taken on our tax returns and included in non-current income taxes payable was approximately $ 15.3 million .\"},\"t6c1\":{\"column_label\":\"$ 201808\",\"locator\":[\"table\",6,1],\"row_label\":\"ending balance as of november 28 2008\",\"text\":\"$ 139549\"}},\"schema_version\":\"finance_qa_vnext_context.v2\",\"source_digest\":\"cbc6c99ad0b81b8999b4b3b5982f8b70ca6a9c31fe26f9cef877a0328c71367d\",\"source_document\":\"ADBE/2008/page_89.pdf\",\"task_id\":\"ADBE/2008/page_89.pdf-3\"},\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request:643097abbf593733dcfac7755c0924f05c174b33c0f1c522483f4dd52845405c\",\"protocol\":{\"action_admission_uses_reference_plan\":false,\"automatic_execution_or_final_repair\":false,\"claim_type\":\"verified_numeric_derivation_not_financial_role_certification\",\"constants\":[\"constant:1\",\"constant:2\",\"constant:3\",\"constant:4\",\"constant:5\",\"constant:100\",\"constant:1000\",\"constant:1000000\"],\"final_semantics\":\"source-symbolic equivalence and exact source arithmetic, numeric publication and unit/citations\",\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_protocol:d11f28b56ab020ad99d97cb6c23cc5db2782d982330f3cee530d4a0b10fda45a\",\"maximum_actions\":12,\"maximum_submissions\":32,\"operations\":{\"absolute\":\"One accepted scalar claim; its absolute value. Never executed implicitly by Final.\",\"add\":\"Two accepted scalar claims/constants, first + second.\",\"average\":\"Two to eight explicitly selected accepted scalar claims/constants; arithmetic mean of selected members.\",\"divide\":\"Two accepted scalar claims/constants, first / second; nonzero denominator.\",\"maximum\":\"Two to eight explicitly selected accepted scalar claims/constants; maximum of selected members.\",\"minimum\":\"Two to eight explicitly selected accepted scalar claims/constants; minimum of selected members.\",\"multiply\":\"Two accepted scalar claims/constants, first * second. Scale conversions must be executed, not merely described.\",\"read\":\"One source: numeric_catalog ID; copy its signed numeric value with exact source identity. No parameters. Reading does not certify relevance or financial units.\",\"subtract\":\"Two accepted scalar claims/constants, first - second.\",\"sum\":\"Two to eight explicitly selected accepted scalar claims/constants; sum all selected members, no implicit row or period selection.\"},\"schema_version\":\"finance_qa_vnext_protocol.v2\",\"version\":\"finqa_source_numeric_h2.v2.2.reason_policy\"},\"protocol_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_protocol:d11f28b56ab020ad99d97cb6c23cc5db2782d982330f3cee530d4a0b10fda45a\",\"response_schemas\":{\"action\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"inputs\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":8,\"minItems\":1,\"title\":\"Inputs\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"kind\":{\"const\":\"action\",\"title\":\"Kind\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"operation\":{\"title\":\"Operation\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":true,\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"reason\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Reason\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"state_id\":{\"title\":\"State Id\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"subgoal\":{\"maxLength\":240,\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Subgoal\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"state_id\",\"subgoal\",\"reason\",\"operation\",\"inputs\",\"parameters\"],\"title\":\"Action\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"final\":{\"$defs\":{\"Result\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"unit\":{\"enum\":[\"percent\",\"USD\",\"USD_million\",\"USD_thousand\"],\"title\":\"Unit\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{\"maxLength\":256,\"pattern\":\"^-?(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:\\\\.[0-9]+)?(?:[eE][+-]?[0-9]{1,3})?$\",\"title\":\"Value\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"value\",\"unit\"],\"title\":\"Result\",\"type\":\"object\"}},\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"answer_claim\":{\"title\":\"Answer Claim\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"citations\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":12,\"title\":\"Citations\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"kind\":{\"const\":\"final\",\"title\":\"Kind\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"result\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/Result\"},\"state_id\":{\"title\":\"State Id\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"state_id\",\"answer_claim\",\"result\",\"citations\"],\"title\":\"Final\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"update\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"disposition\":{\"enum\":[\"accept\",\"reject\"],\"title\":\"Disposition\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"kind\":{\"const\":\"update\",\"title\":\"Kind\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"observation\":{\"description\":\"Update.observation is an ID, not an assessment or explanation. Copy state.pending_observation.id exactly. Express your judgment only in disposition: accept or reject. Do not write prose in observation. The Host never fills this field or accepts an observation on your behalf.\",\"title\":\"Observation\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"state_id\":{\"title\":\"State Id\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"state_id\",\"observation\",\"disposition\"],\"title\":\"Update\",\"type\":\"object\"}},\"rules\":{\"actions\":\"Propose your own subgoal, operation and ordered inputs. No plan or next-step candidates are supplied. parameters must be {}. All outputs are scalar numeric derivations with source provenance; you must decide financial relevance, periods, signs and scales.\",\"inputs\":\"read takes one source: ID from numeric_catalog. Other operations take accepted Claim IDs or listed constant: IDs, never raw source IDs, bare numbers, observations or subgoal names.\",\"pending\":\"Only Update accept/reject is legal while an observation is pending. A read or computation is not usable until YOU accept it. Accepted claims are immutable.\",\"publication\":\"Final requires no pending observation and one accepted answer Claim. result has exactly value (decimal string, no % sign, within 0.00001 of that Claim) and unit (context.answer_unit). Ratios answering a percentage question must actually be multiplied by 100 before Final; changing the printed value/unit is not an executed conversion. citations must be unique and exactly the answer Claim's lineage. No host arithmetic repair.\",\"reason_limit\":\"Keep Action reason concise and nonempty; there is no per-reason character cap. Existing response-size and session resource limits still apply. subgoal: at most 240 characters.\",\"state_id\":\"Copy state.id exactly for every submission.\",\"update_reference\":\"Update.observation is an ID, not an assessment or explanation. Copy state.pending_observation.id exactly. Express your judgment only in disposition: accept or reject. Do not write prose in observation. The Host never fills this field or accepts an observation on your behalf.\",\"verification_scope\":\"Intermediate validity is numeric and source-lexical, not correct financial use. Final must establish the original question's financial target with source-anchored algebra, not just coincidentally match its number. Alternative arithmetic grouping is permitted. Unsupported alternative evidence equivalences can remain outside this bounded oracle.\"},\"schema_version\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request.v2\",\"state\":{\"action_count\":6,\"claims\":[{\"accepted_by_request_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request:2cbe062aeaa2e4ea222c107ed7d4b88270dbaf9f8fe286e3cd88cab2d58688a1\",\"claim_type\":\"numeric_derivation\",\"exact_value\":\"153/10\",\"expression\":\"source:q2n2\",\"financial_target_certified\":false,\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_claim:18fae532a56cea7b3b44887d184501e3009ae5396be9367f44c9b4b884046ee4\",\"lineage\":[\"source:q2n2\"],\"observation_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_observation:0de27c9971501c719cf0018226a155b52b494690b15efb8e8738323c47fec819\",\"schema_version\":\"finance_qa_vnext_claim.v2\",\"session_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_e1_reason_policy_registration:d243866ccfda74ecb0df6698723c00fa43464c8e8fd41b2ee142fdec2ea4fb93\",\"status\":\"accepted\",\"value\":\"15.3\"},{\"accepted_by_request_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request:2c09e3e744385e4ef2a82ab77a51a58649ce61ddcf574b65771cad47099ebe36\",\"claim_type\":\"numeric_derivation\",\"exact_value\":\"139549\",\"expr